.TH AGENTOP 1 "April 2026" "agentop" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
agentop \- Terminal dashboard for Claude Code sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B agentop
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B agentop
reads ~/.claude/projects/ and shows token usage, cost, and cache efficiency
in a duf-style terminal dashboard.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "\-\-claude-dir" " DIR"
Path to Claude data directory (default: ~/.claude)
.TP
.BI "\-\-since" " DATE"
Date filter: "today", "7d", "30d", or "2026-04-01" (default: today)
.TP
.BI "\-\-until" " DATE"
End date filter
.TP
.BI "\-\-project" " PATH"
Filter by project path (partial match)
.TP
.BI "\-\-model" " MODEL"
Filter by model: opus, sonnet, haiku
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output as JSON
.TP
.B \-\-compact
Force compact layout
.TP
.B \-\-no-color
Disable colors
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-watch
Live refresh mode
.TP
.BI "\-\-refresh" " SECS"
Refresh interval in seconds (default: 5)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show version
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B today
Show today's sessions (default)
.TP
.B daily
Show daily session reports
.TP
.B monthly
Show monthly session summaries
.TP
.B session
Deep-dive into a single session
.TP
.B blocks
Show 5-hour billing window report
.TP
.B doctor
Anomaly detection and insights
.TP
.B config
Show effective config and pricing
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B agentop
Show today's sessions
.TP
.B agentop --since 7d
Show last 7 days
.TP
.B agentop --watch
Live refresh mode
.TP
.B agentop doctor
Run anomaly detection
